  "validation_rules": [
    "Every reference resolves in its namespace or through one explicit canonical alias",
    "Aliases may not chain",
    "Every API response and domain-group entity resolves to one strict schema definition",
    "Every allowed transition names defined nonterminal source states and defined destinations",
    "Every terminal state has no outgoing allowed transition",
    "Fixture surfaces and state sets equal the contract exactly",
    "Fixture top-level and per-surface/state keys are exact",
    "Evidence excerpts contain no more than fifteen whitespace-delimited words",
    "Baseline values remain absent until instrumented or interviewed",
    "Authoritative tenant context is server-derived and immutable for the request; no client tenant selector exists",
    "Every cross-tenant denial fixture channel returns privacy-safe nonexistent parity without object metadata or business payload",
    "Workflow lifecycle is exactly experimental, pilot, approved, standard, retired and calendar passage never promotes",
    "Maintenance target is distinct from the null observed baseline and exceptions are separately attributed",
    "Organization tenant, human sponsor, partner, runtime agent, capability profile, and personal brain scope/version are separate immutable server-derived dimensions",
    "Missing or ambiguous personal scope is failure or Unknown with null count, never successful zero",
    "Personal rules cannot cross-load, choose tenant, grant capability, silently promote, or replace runtime-agent attribution",
    "Identity audit retains safe tenant, agent, sponsor, brain scope/version/counts, and capability fields without rule bodies"
    ,"Market map entity class and location role remain separate; records may be unlocated or contribute multiple versioned locations"
    ,"Market aggregates report current, stale, Unknown, and unlocated children and never render Fresh when any child is unresolved"
    ,"Map/list parity, server-derived tenant/workspace scope, sterile-mode denial, and provider-isolated geocode/route evidence are load-bearing"
  ]
